message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
abstract: TULIP (Trusted Unified Legal Intake Portal) is a web application
  created in partnership between OSS and the SLU School of Law Clinic Program.
  It is a digital intake portal for all clinics within the program to replace
  the current paper-based intake system. Case-assignment workflows are
  standardized through this tool for more efficient document management.
